    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a challenging yet fascinating subject for me. I enjoy its logical structure and problem-solving aspects, especially when it comes to algebra or geometry. However, I sometimes struggle with more abstract concepts like calculus, which require deeper analytical thinking. Despite the difficulties, I appreciate how math applies to real-world scenarios, making it both practical and intellectually stimulating.",
